# Mile High Pitch 2019 — Environment Configuration Reference
#
# RUNTIME REQUIREMENTS:
# The browser client application is a static client-side Vite SPA.
# No website runtime environment variable is currently required.
# The existing application build does NOT consume VITE_BASE_URL.
# Form submissions are routed directly from the client to Formspree (form ID: xwlealvn).
#
# BASE PATH CONFIGURATION:
# The application references import.meta.env.BASE_URL, which is supplied
# by Vite's build configuration (defaulting to '/'). The eventual production
# base path will be established during the later hosting/deployment architecture decision.
#
# WORKSPACE DISTINCTION:
# Generic AI Studio starter variables (GEMINI_API_KEY, APP_URL) are NOT required
# by the Mile High Pitch 2019 editorial archive website.
